          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-4">
            Empowering bootstrapped founders, indie hackers, and remote engineers to maximize financial runway, eliminate dilutive venture capital dependency, and achieve default alive profitability through global geo-arbitrage.
          </p>
